FACT #1 (subject: marco): "Marco drove the getaway van"

The new fact is that Marco is an undercover police officer. This changes the meaning of "getaway van" — if Marco is undercover police, the van may not be a getaway van in the criminal sense, or the fact may no longer be accurately described that way. The fact as written assumes Marco was participating in a crime as a driver. With the new information, a careful record-keeper would likely not write "getaway van" exactly as is.

